/trace*.py
/trace*.out
/test-time.js
# Throwaway PR-body draft the pr command used to leave at the repo root
# after a `gh pr create`.  The file is named with a leading dot but git
# tracks it once it exists — keep it out of the index in the first place.
.tmp-pr-body*
.tmp-pr-*.md
# Local-only debug scratch the Claude audit (`docs/audits/2026-09-24-efficiency-audit.md`,
